{"id":"vod_bf_38178","vodId":"38178","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"向山进发第二季","name_cn":"向山进发第二季","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"国产动漫","remarks":"更新至第24集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-39/f33f7c83cbec169ac84fabbd1fd8a32f.jpg"},"summary":"故事以女高中生进行登山活动为主题，讲述了喜欢室内活动并患有恐高症的主角葵，在重遇喜欢户外活动的青梅竹马朋友日向后，因希望能像儿时在山顶看日出，而再次进行登山活动。「向山进发」是由曾担任PC游戏「交响乐之雨」角色设计并负责其原画的插画家Shiro(しろ)所绘的漫画作品，自 月刊漫画杂志「Comic Earth Star」2011年9月号上开始连载，至今已推出了5卷单行本。作品以女子高中生登山为主题，讲述了以喜好室内活动并且有恐高症的主人公雪村葵、有着户外活动意向的青梅竹马日向的再会作为契机，为了能再次看到年幼时看过的山顶日出而登山的物语。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:46:03","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xiangshanjinfadierji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xiangshanjinfadierji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xiangshanjinfadierji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xiangshanjinfadierji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xiangshanjinfadierji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xiangshanjinfadierji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xiangshanjinfadierji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xiangshanjinfadierji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xiangshanjinfadierji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xiangshanjinfadierji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xiangshanjinfadierji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xiangshanjinfadierji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xiangshanjinfadierji/第13集/index.m